{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:10:00', 'title': 'QUANTA SERVICES ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "HOUSTON , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUANTA SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: PWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS OF $0.08 PER SHARE, OR A RATE OF $0.32 PER SHARE ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS, WHICH REPRESENTS AN APPROXIMATELY 14% INCREASE FROM QUANTA'S LAST QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND PAID IN OCTOBER 2022. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 13, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JANUARY 3, 2023."}